+# Upstream #286 on tp3-main (2026-11-13)
+
+> Commit ids shown as [unpublished] belong to the local history before the 2026-11-14 port and are not in the public repository.
+
+Branch `ds41-upstream-285-286` (worktree `~/flare-up-rust1113`) from `tp3-main` [unpublished]. Local and Gitea
+only. It replaces the stopped full sync (`sync-20261113`, see `SYNC-20261113.md` there): that sync is
+blocked by upstream's Inductor storage-planning rewrite (commits 16bb710f..d095e9e4), which removes the
+graph-scratch memory model that the DS41/GLM TP3 lines build on.
+
+## Picked
+
+| Upstream | What | Here |
+| --- | --- | --- |
